  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHARE is Planting tree&apos;s! Believes every Child deserves a healthy and safe environment now and a sustainable future. We want to ensure that all children can enjoy these rights. The climate crisis affects everyone, vulnerable communities are taking the strongest hit. If left unchecked, climate change will undo a lot of the progress made over the past years in development. It can also exacerbate, as we are already seeing, current threats such as food and water scarcity, which can lead to conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
